<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Classroom Rules</title>

    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            background: #fff8ed;
            padding: 20px;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: auto;
            background: white;
            padding: 30px;
            border-radius: 15px;
        }

        h1 {
            text-align: center;
        }

        .rule {
            padding: 15px;
            margin: 12px 0;
            background: #fafafa;
            border-radius: 10px;
        }

        .number {
            font-size: 22px;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        .positive {
            margin-top: 25px;
            padding: 18px;
            background: #eef8ee;
            border-radius: 10px;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

<div class="container">

    <h1>📋 Classroom Rules</h1>

    <p>
        Following simple classroom rules helps create a respectful
        and comfortable learning environment.
    </p>

    <div class="rule">
        <span class="number">1.</span>
        <strong> Be on Time</strong>
        <p>Arrive in class before the lesson begins.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="rule">
        <span class="number">2.</span>
        <strong> Listen Carefully</strong>
        <p>Pay attention when the teacher or another student is speaking.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="rule">
        <span class="number">3.</span>
        <strong> Respect Everyone</strong>
        <p>Treat teachers and classmates politely.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="rule">
        <span class="number">4.</span>
        <strong> Complete Your Work</strong>
        <p>Try to complete assignments and classroom activities on time.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="rule">
        <span class="number">5.</span>
        <strong> Keep the Classroom Clean</strong>
        <p>Put waste in the proper place and take care of classroom materials.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="positive">
        <strong>🌟 Good Classroom Habits:</strong>
        Be respectful, responsible, curious and ready to learn.
    </div>

</div>

</body>
</html>
